  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-2.1, F-2.3, F-4.6]
  why: The app opens straight onto a canvas, but opening a shared space must not write into it.
```

```mdl
decision D-12: The client runs with EDGE signaling and with EDGE replicators and agents off; account-less identities sync peer to peer while another member is online. Fills in [D-5].
  date: 2026-11-14
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-7]
  why: Since edge#1510 an identity with no Hub account gets only swarm and signal frames; replicator frames are dropped and the space-root route returns 403, which the client retries forever. Turning replication on waits for [Q-2].
  rejected:
    - Replicators on: no data moves and every space logs 403 retries.
```

