  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:wittjosiah
  affects: [F-9.3, F-9.5]
  why: The centre and zoom mean the same in a view of any size, so a follower in a narrow Composer plank and a leader full-screen here look at the same place; the camera's own offset depends on the view's size.
  rejected:
    - The visible scene rectangle, fitted: a view of another shape zooms differently from the leader, so the shapes do not keep their size.
```

