  why: On the preview EDGE neither the Subduction-only build nor the all-features build saw an error after boot in 90 seconds, solo or joined from Composer, and both relayed an edit made while the other member was offline. Where EDGE refuses an unbound identity, the features cost a few refused requests at boot and nothing more, so turning them off bought nothing and made the app differ from Composer.
